    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="Prolog">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IAtr">I Atr</ref> Prolog</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Ðis is seo gerædnys þe Æþelred cining ⁊ his witan geræddon, eallon folce to friðes bote, æt Wudestoce on Myrcena lande, æfter Engla lage.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">This is the ordinance which King Æthelred and his councillors have enacted, at Woodstock in Mercia, for the promotion of public security, wherever English law prevails.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Ðis is seo gerædnys, ðe Æþelred cyning ⁊ his witan geræddon, eallon folce to friþes bote, æt Wudestoce on Myrcena lande, æfter Engla lage.</ab>
      </div>
